{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4d91783d67b51caf9d43edf46c68160bc15fa6d5c203966d3c85a771a3baaf9a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e889ae7777df79ff06c99f1b78886f5fd94780f76cd78884c47dfca2645cd98",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e42eccbbfcddba73f7817f5b8c76e8bddb98750f5b39498e74f2ab697f49a83",
      "text": "我这边衣服也换好了，正准备过去\n和你们汇合。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7000283b99376b018d0a9dfefb47c656d7fd2b146a481dd25a8ac6f3e44174a",
      "text": "我打算最后去一趟企鹅的水槽，\n然后再过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1952436c9215e10b847814f874ab365778a07b491b30df52ae022de11a008a41",
      "text": "虽说只有一天的拍摄，但也是背靠着背一起游过水的情分了。\n总得去道个谢才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dc75dde974c1abb65c251b1948e0bf0f26da77df56355fc23afa666ecf6f706",
      "text": "企鹅们，\n很亲近您呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8db3304d7aa15339412173140b2637a852e2aeffbb10123d1891af535878a75",
      "text": "一起游泳的姿态，\n拍出了好照片呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf8a44ee7ded9f71d338014d3e872596f014b006554ca0e2f7078e50935f62e",
      "text": "嗯。除了拍摄时，每次我从附近走过它们都\n跟上来，我也吃了一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6ed5d2b7f06a02f914dba83385ab02b8393687001f660747a47ecdc74bba9c",
      "text": "因为它们一直跟着，拍摄挺顺利的。\n番长拍的花絮照，也很棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef10517b9946548ddf9c0be742ed9b88b636856ad79d42dad0707a8570427973",
      "text": "我平时经常看着朱雀和喵子的互动嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d484dd500284f9e46db8e2cc6b05183b40f7cbe6bfbe5b8485a4e2a5d2dda42",
      "text": "本来就想着要像他们那样，把企鹅当成同等的同伴来相处……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be990fee718b17ebe4d07e3f9238674c391a2ae3ce3d1e500513ea34490f865d",
      "text": "想着“一起拍出好照片吧”的那份干劲，\n就算不用言语似乎也传达给它们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1586147187639a7b77c1f2f347e43a73dac8b27cc4313a7656387765df3b3828",
      "text": "从照片中也能感受到这份信任",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c99a2ee34fce6daf509aa58da69a00413efdf298bef9c3cddfc8bf27d530e0",
      "text": "嗯。那张照片要是印成海报，\n那些家伙肯定会变得更受欢迎吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7279e041346426485b99dd2a6030cb5676bf8a1011e1a516d66d0306b901879f",
      "text": "以后有机会的话，我也再来看看它们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:026gen_402_2_4_026_02_09_a:2_4_026_02_09_a:cmd-000042:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a53cbb33d912ded74ee8b4555d5d6edbab73ba549d058d1871f0cd6843de66f5",
      "text": "为了能挺起胸膛去和它们重逢，\n今后的工作我也要充满干劲地去拼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
